X:1
T:Dagula
O:Mongolia (Inner Mongolia)
N:Mongolian folk song of the Julim League (Inner Mongolia, China), from the mu-tech.org WorldTrad MIDI. Melody diffed note by note; the setting plays the eight bars twice. Its accompaniment is chromatic arpeggios, so the chords here are derived from the melody. Source note values kept (sixteenths written as c/).
M:4/4
Q:1/4=80
L:1/8
K:Gm
